---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { BOOKING_URL } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
	title="Contact Steven Yule about a review or advisory work"
	sheet="Contact"
	description="Contact Steven Yule at OkArthur about an independent review of a digital or AI investment decision, or about advisory, board, speaking and writing work."
>
	<div class="page-head">
		<h1 class="page-title">Contact</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			Email <a href="mailto:steven@okarthur.com">steven@okarthur.com</a>, or
			connect on <a
				href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/stevenyule"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
			>.
		</p>
		<p>
			If you would prefer to talk first, <a
				href={BOOKING_URL}
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">book a 30-minute call</a
			> at a time that suits you. Booking goes through Calendly, which asks for
			your name and email address.
		</p>

		<h2>If you are considering a <a href="/review/">review</a></h2>
		<p>
			It helps if your first message says what the decision is and when it has
			to be made. Mention any other developments it affects and who has to be
			convinced. Describe the parties by role and not by name, such as the
			main contractor or the platform supplier.
		</p>
		<p>
			A short call follows, then a fixed-fee proposal. I take on a small
			number of engagements at a time. I will tell you on the first call
			whether I can take yours on.
		</p>

		<h2>If you are considering continuing advisory</h2>
		<p>
			Tell me what is being decided or going to market over the coming months.
			Say where you need someone independent involved. Describe the people
			and firms by role here too.
		</p>

		<h2>Board, speaking and media</h2>
		<p>
			Board approaches and speaking invitations come to the same address. If
			you are writing for the press, mark your message as a press enquiry. The <a
				href="/media/">media page</a
			> has a biography and a photo you can use.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>
